# Daddy Pay

Read [AGENTS.md](../../docs/AGENTS.md), [RULE.md](../../docs/RULE.md), [DESIGN.md](../../docs/DESIGN.md) for full context.

## Auth

- Session: httpOnly cookie `token`. Backend: `{API_URL}/api/v1/admin/*`.
- Middleware validates pages; `/api/*` excluded — each route checks `cookies().get('token')`.
- **Never** put full user JSON in `x-user-data` (502 from proxy header limits). Use `getData()` → `/admin/me` via cookie.
- Token refresh: forward `X-New-Token` / `X-Token-Refreshed` via `createResponseWithHeaders` / middleware.

## API routes

```typescript
const token = (await cookies()).get('token')?.value;
if (!token) return NextResponse.json({ message: 'Unauthorized' }, { status: 401 });
const response = await axios.get(`${process.env.API_URL}/api/v1/admin/...`, {
  headers: { Authorization: `Bearer ${token}` },
});
return createResponseWithHeaders(response.data, response);
// 401 → handleTokenExpiration()
```

## Code

- BFF only from browser (`/api/...`), not `API_URL` in client.
- **New/changed features** (required layers):
  1. `page.tsx` — hook + `<Feature>View vm={vm} />` only
  2. `use<Feature>ViewModel.ts` — state/handlers, no JSX
  3. `services/<feature>Service.ts` — axios only
  4. `components/<Feature>/` — split UI: `*View.tsx` composes `*Header`, `*Filter`, `*Table`, `*Modal` (not one bloated View)
- References: `LanguageSettings/`, `ShopManagementTransaction/`
- axios only in `services/` or BFF routes — never in `page.tsx`, View, or sub-components
- **UI design**: follow `docs/DESIGN.md#ui-design-system-required` — Bootstrap + Tailwind + FA; reuse `TableComponent`, `FormGroup/*`, `Modals/*`; page shell `bg-white p-2 md:p-4`; Header/Filter/Table/Modal split; copy `ShopInfo/`, `ShopManagementTransaction/`, `LanguageSettings/`
- UI text: `lang['key']` + `languageDefault.json`; status via `utils/*Utils.ts` + `text-success`/`text-danger`
- Minimize diff; `@/` imports; commit only when user asks.
